// ONE CASKET PER TIER, STACKABLE - Old School's shape, replacing 103 of them.
//
// WHAT WAS WRONG. The 377 cache carries a casket obj PER CLUE - trail_clue_easy_map001_casket,
// _map002_casket, and so on, 103 of them across the three tiers - and every one of them is named
// "Casket (easy)", "Casket (medium)" or "Casket (hard)". A player could not tell them apart and
// never needed to, because nothing at runtime reads which one it is: progress_clue_easy takes the
// casket, deletes it, and rolls a RANDOM next clue (game_trail/scripts/easy/trail_clue_easy.rs2).
// The identity was dead weight that filled a bank with items that would not merge.
//
// Old School has one reward casket per tier for the same reason. These three are that, with the
// 2006 names kept because in this build the casket is still the thing you DIG UP mid-trail - open
// it and you get the next clue, or the reward if the trail is done - and "Reward casket" would be
// a promise it does not make until the last step.
//
// STACKABLE, which Old School's are not. Asked for by name, and the reason it is safe here is the
// same reason the identity was dead: two easy caskets are the same object in every way that the
// game reads, so a stack of them cannot lose anything. What it does mean is that one bank slot
// holds a trail's worth instead of one each.
//
// WEIGHT 0, and that is the one number that changed. The cache's caskets weigh 5kg each, which was
// a fair cost when you could only be carrying a few; a stack of forty would be 200kg and would
// pin a player to the floor. A pile of boxes you are allowed to keep should not be an anchor.
//
// THE OLD ONES STILL WORK and are deliberately left alone: all 103 keep their category, so the
// [opheld1,_trail_casket_*] trigger that opens these opens those too, and anything already in a
// bank opens exactly as it did. Nothing is migrated and nothing is deleted.

[casket_easy]
name=Casket (easy)
desc=I hope there's treasure in it.
model=obj_casket
2dxof=3
2dyof=-6
2dzoom=1410
2dyan=1592
2dxan=164
cost=50
iop1=Open
members=yes
weight=0g
stackable=yes
category=trail_casket_easy
tradeable=no

